ntor-element elementor-element-b448cb3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b448cb3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b7433f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7b7433f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pourquoi \u00e9tudier au Togo ? <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c02bd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c02bd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Le Togo, aussi appel\u00e9 la perle de l&rsquo;Afrique de l&rsquo;Ouest est une destination id\u00e9ale pour se faire former. Le syst\u00e8me \u00e9ducatif Togolais offre aux \u00e9tudiants une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de fili\u00e8re et de programme d&rsquo;\u00e9tudes. Les universit\u00e9s et les instituts jouent un r\u00f4le clef dans la formation des \u00e9tudiants et de la promotion de la recherche acad\u00e9mique.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b22500 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9b22500\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ff027e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6ff027e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/togo.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-48516\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/togo.png 1024w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/togo-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/w